  "details": "There are a lot of cheaters that use these skins in like Murder 4 and stuff. Disabling their avatar doesn’t work either. Even disabling animations through your Safety settings doesn’t fix it.\nThese avatars can have name tags fully hidden like underground. Some users have avatars that put their camera’s under ground and they can see the name tags of invisible avatars.\nI don’t know how people do this but yeah.\nOne way to stop this is by players opening their menu’s and hovering over the invisible person’s hit box to show the blue outline.",
